cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MAVILERA, please cite it as below. The DOI cites all versions; each release also has its own DOI on Zenodo."
type: software
title: "MAVILERA: Interactive Microprocessor Architecture Laboratory"
abstract: >-
  MAVILERA (Microprocessor Architecture Visualization, Interactive Learning, Execution, and Runtime Analysis) is an
  open-source, architecture-neutral educational platform of browser-based processor simulators: RISC-V, SAP-1, SAP-2,
  Armv7, an NPU tool, a GPU laboratory, the 8086 and a Raspberry Pi Pico 2 laboratory with the RP2350's Hazard3 cores.
  Every simulator runs entirely in the browser.
